A line block in an item child keeps its stanza after a comment or marker-shaped payload

```
- - ::: |
    %% c
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p><br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- :: u
  : ::: |
    x
    %% c
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>x<br>
<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- :: u
  : ::: |
     [x]: /u
    - l
       :::
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>&nbsp;[x]: /u<br>
- l<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;:::<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```
